 "description":
 "A turn-based command battle. A party of four (lead, caster, guard, mender) acts in seat order, then the foe. Attacks build the lead's gauge; a skill spends half of it; a full gauge allows a finisher; a spell takes a turn to cast; a taunting guard draws the foe's strikes and blocks part of each; the mender heals a few times a round. A run is 30 rounds (normal) or 60 (plus); the next-round method makes each foe stronger.",
 "actions":
 {"victory":
  {"params": [],
   "description": "The foe is down: the round is won.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/foe/hp"}}},
    {"value": 1, "pointer/set": "/result/won"}]},
  "skip-mender":
  {"params": [],
   "description": "A fallen mender loses the turn.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 3,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/turn/slot"}}},
    {"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/mender/hp"}}},
    {"value": 4, "pointer/set": "/turn/slot"}]},
  "skip-lead":
  {"params": [],
   "description": "A fallen lead loses the turn.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/turn/slot"}}},
    {"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/lead/hp"}}},
    {"value": 1, "pointer/set": "/turn/slot"}]},
  "skip-guard":
  {"params": [],
   "description": "A fallen guard loses the turn.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 2,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/turn/slot"}}},
    {"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/guard/hp"}}},
    {"value": 3, "pointer/set": "/turn/slot"}]},
  "skip-caster":
  {"params": [],
   "description": "A fallen caster loses the turn.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 1,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/turn/slot"}}},
    {"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 0,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/caster/hp"}}},
    {"value": 2, "pointer/set": "/turn/slot"}]},
  "next-round":
  {"params": ["r", "fh", "fa", "lh", "ch", "gh", "mh"],
   "description":
   "The next round: a stronger foe, the party back to full, taunt and spell cleared, heals restored; the lead keeps its gauge.",
   "body":
   [{"eval":
     {"type": "math/eq",
      "b": 1,
      "a": {"type": "pointer/get", "pointer": "/result/won"}}},
    {"value": {"param": "r"}, "pointer/set": "/run/round"},
    {"value": {"param": "fh"}, "pointer/set": "/foe/hp"},
    {"value": {"param": "fh"}, "pointer/set": "/foe/max"},
    {"value": {"param": "fa"}, "pointer/set": "/foe/atk"},
    {"value": {"param": "lh"}, "pointer/set": "/lead/hp"},
    {"value": {"param": "ch"}, "pointer/set": "/caster/hp"},
    {"value": {"param": "gh"}, "pointer/set": "/guard/hp"},
    {"value": {"param": "mh"}, "pointer/set": "/mender/hp"},
    {"value": 0, "pointer/set": "/caster/charge"},
    {"value": 0, "pointer/set": "/guard/taunt"},
    {"value": 3, "pointer/set": "/mender/heals"},
    {"value": 0, "pointer/set": "/turn/slot"},
    {"value": 0, "pointer/set": "/result/won"}]},
